        900,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**UNVALIDATED_INSTALL — inactive template**\n\nRun this workflow independently of the dispatcher. Lease expiry and offline hosts must be detected even when an error workflow never runs. Started calls remain blocked for reconciliation rather than being automatically resubmitted.\n\nConfirm installed n8n version, runner reachability, existing credential/account mapping, and FREE_CREDITS_ONLY balances before activation. No paid fallback. No actual API or concurrency evidence is implied by this export.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 600
      }
    }
